{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52165","headline":"采莲赋附歌 · 王勃","name":"采莲赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荣华息，功名恻（以上二句，《英华》作「芳草惧修名」，周必大等校《英华》引集本作「芳华惧功名」），奇秀兮异植，红光兮碧色。\n禀天地之淑丽，承雨露之沾饰（周引集本作「华饰」），莲有藕兮藕有枝，才有用兮用有时，何当婀娜花（《英华》作「华」）实移，爲君含香藻凤池。\n（见《四部丛刊》本《王子安集》卷二，校以《文苑英华》卷一四八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}